WEBVTT

00:14:28.447 --> 00:14:32.326
I wonder what would have been
different in my own life,

00:14:32.326 --> 00:14:35.037
and maybe in many other people’s lives,

00:14:35.037 --> 00:14:40.167
if only we could have access
to this supportive community

00:14:40.167 --> 00:14:41.960
of millions of young people

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.504
and their distributing mentoring

00:14:44.504 --> 00:14:45.505
as kids.

00:14:46.632 --> 00:14:47.633
Thank you.

00:14:47.633 --> 00:14:52.596
(Applause and cheers)